      <div class="cav">Let the wheel decide</div>
      <h1>Is an Online Spin Wheel <em>Actually Fair?</em></h1>
      <p class="dek">A spin wheel is only as fair as the random number behind it, and most sites will not tell you what they use. Here is what really makes a spin fair, how the odds work as names drop out, and why a wheel that runs in your browser with no signup is the honest way to pick a winner.</p>
      <div class="byline"><span><b>Best Answer Hub</b></span><span>~8 min read</span><span>Utility</span><span>No signup</span></div>
